This was my first Knight ascension, and it was pretty interesting.  The
ability to kill things with either magic or dual-wielded swords is
quite nice.  Aside from some minor drawbacks, such as not getting any
good artifacts until the late game, not finding any magic markers until
Gehennom, and having my robe and gray dragon scale mail disintegrated
by a black dragon at one point, things went fairly smoothly.  (I even
found Lugh's high altar on the first try.)

